0..73 Comment "// A model whose carrier is manifest where a model of its theory is asked"
74..150 Comment "// (#2120): each theory with an unindexed sort takes one forgetting map from"
151..228 Comment "// `Model(T) with sort C = x` to `Model(T)`, at every carrier `x`, which puts"
229..306 Comment "// the carrier back as the record\'s first field. The checker applies it where"
307..383 Comment "// the one model stands at the other, solving `x` from the model\'s type, and"
384..458 Comment "// the run reads the application. The map is a family in the carrier, so a"
459..536 Comment "// manifest model carried along an equivalence of carriers is read alike once"
537..550 Comment "// forgotten."
552..627 Comment "// The counter, counting up and down modulo three, the negation between the"
628..678 Comment "// counts, and `observe`, which reads any counter."
